Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.05,0:00:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:03.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒珊瑚犬夜叉还有戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各个勇者都已经立过大功
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就等我用震荡陀螺打败奈落了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这集看我七宝大爷的表演吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:35.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:48.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:01:01.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:06.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.65,0:01:14.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:18.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:23.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:27.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:32.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:35.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:39.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:46.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,累死了 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,累死了 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴 继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下好不好 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下啦 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能休息一下下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:40.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:41.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:54.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的妖怪居然想吃我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢小看我 今天碰到我算你倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要走了喔 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扔下我听到没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是…他是勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 不会错的 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:16.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是传说中的勇士了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:28.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第130话 七宝绝招出动心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我爹还有我娘都已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还是可以过的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还有这么多的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是很不错的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我反而替你担心 水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在人类的世界这么的乱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你也不用替我担心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我遇见了七宝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我也一样 水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:11.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝这小子 怎么经过的每个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是能和女孩子打成一片呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝这种作风
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是受到身边那位仁兄的影响呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要妖怪敢现身的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上帮你们收服它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 要是躲在深山里面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕需要多花些时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这一点我也很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那关于这住宿问题…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论多久 都请你们一定要住下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:41.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况允许的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能让村里的年轻姑娘们来照顾…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:49.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么晚饭时候 就叫她们过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:51.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好还能留下来过夜…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你太得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别生气嘛 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 太无趣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么打听 也不过是些杂碎妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.67,0:05:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟四魂之玉碎片也没什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难让人提起劲来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.61,0:05:11.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位壮士 千万别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用理会这种村子了 不如还是快走…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:25.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝的同伴们都这么粗暴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别理他们 都是一些小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我可以靠嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们这就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都拜托大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就拜托你了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:52.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不需要我出马吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说万一妖怪突然袭击村子怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 一切拜托大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我去附近稍微巡视一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪看到一定会很高兴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候一定会乐坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:36.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三 四
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们突然跑出来是想干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来拜见狐妖大前辈 七宝老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这年头 连妖怪的世界也乱得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那个坏蛋到处胡作非为
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他坏蛋们也趁机为所欲为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此外我们狐妖一家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也被这些坏蛋追得到处逃窜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们五兄弟跟爹娘走散了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只好到处流浪 一边找寻爹娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在此时 我们听说了七宝老大您的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一群与坏蛋奈落战斗的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们之中不是有一个狐妖勇者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那的确是在说我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 我们会好好努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你教教我们让我们变得跟你一样强
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你收我们为徒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其…其实我没那么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会不会 老大的传说我们知道的很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:54.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家说你身为妖怪 却带领着巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 南无阿弥陀佛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带领好几位武艺高超的勇者的不就是七宝老大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…带领他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉只不过是我的仆人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人类全都是靠我罩着他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 请你把绝招传授给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟奈落对打时总会有绝招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的绝招？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你们是指这招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 震荡陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:54.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:08:59.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您就别再耍我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再耍我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有更厉害的绝招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更厉害的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像豆之浆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感之冒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茶之水啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像这么厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.99,0:09:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你们说的是风之伤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请务必传授给我们 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不过呢…这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个在这里给我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是个男子汉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道妖怪出现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快借给我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤借一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:13.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 风之伤到底要怎么发动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛突然问这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想用用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要让自己变得更厉害才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样子乱挥一通是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你 你的鼻子不是很灵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:32.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定闻得到妖气的流动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就从那里喀喀喀穿过去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:37.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后嗤叭叭就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:43.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:45.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么喀喀喀嗤叭叭的 我不懂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 就是喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么办法嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到没有 就像这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 门打坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 七宝…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然给我溜掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:23.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会向那个犬夜叉讨教 我也太笨了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚当然是去找来村子捣乱的妖怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 差点忘了有东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我还要继续去找妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪你先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:52.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 自己要小心点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们什么时候来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你们 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有什么风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真厉害 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:19.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以这么高明的手段耍了一个人类少女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦 我并不是在耍她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们狐妖来说 欺骗凡人可是流传下来的传统
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们岂能输给狸猫它们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算什么时候让那个小女孩尝尝苦头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有要…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝老大亲自出马 一定是更有威力的花招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好想看 好想看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这些小鬼到底在胡说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚开 小狐狸们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这家伙就是危害村民的妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得马上去通知犬夜叉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:09.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底知不知道这位是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位就是我们狐妖界鼎鼎有名的七宝老大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逃的应该是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:20.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不乖乖的向我们赔罪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然要你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候 七宝老大的威力会吓死你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会吓死你 吓死你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干…干嘛抓着我不放
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样 就让我陪你过几招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:36.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有请老大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 我随时奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 脱逃之术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你是在耍本大爷是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.91,0:14:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 这几个小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算甩掉它们了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气息是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问老大你真的是狐妖界的勇者七宝大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:26.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当…当然是了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:29.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是七宝 错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝老大应该很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该也有绝招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你刚刚为什么要逃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:43.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因…因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因…因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大你不是要去耍她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请老大露两手给我们瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好想看 好想看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:05.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这种迷惑人类少女这种事 我并不…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 你真的是狐妖界的勇士七宝大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我就是七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:22.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如假包换
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好香喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜呜呜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会变成这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会变成这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看镖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛 讨厌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别欺负人家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:02.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没…没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你做的吗 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身都湿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:44.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:08.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实…这并不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初恋又再一次的结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道厉害了吧 臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚竟然被你们的那点小把戏给耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一次 一定要和你们一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我闭嘴 什么老大嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:44.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你肯乖乖向本大爷赔罪的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你无缘无故跑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不会…就不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭…臭小子 讨打是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你出来捣乱 我就不会做出那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪也就不会误会我讨厌我了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭…臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就轮到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了 是妖气的流动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大终于使出绝招了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:52.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招叫做…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比风之伤更厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛… 心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:22.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也一起上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们一起上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:34.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个真是受益不浅呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我们使用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.99,0:19:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你们用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样以后我们什么都不用怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能够去找爹和娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.87,0:20:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然时间很短暂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们永远不会忘记老大的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢老大的教导
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初恋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再让我碰见 绝对不放过他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身麻痹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:50.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于把妖怪收服了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南无阿弥陀佛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常谢谢你们 真是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也不是什么了不起的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两三下就搞定了 心里还真有点失望呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛七宝 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:19.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说那妖怪一下就把你打败了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不在乎这种事咧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…水纪…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干了什么呀 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么人家这么讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛…你在干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这两个人在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是佛祖对他的考验吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.93,0:22:24.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.05,0:22:40.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:46.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:50.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:55.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:06.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:14.32,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:17.64,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.10,0:23:22.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:28.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家正要开始调查鬼女部落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.17,0:23:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏弥勒法师又犯了色戒了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底你跟弥勒法师有没有怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:23:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:24:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次去白灵山的时候 你不是跟他单独相处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有留下甜蜜的回忆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟弥勒法师之间什么关系也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.98,0:24:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是一直都觉得弥勒法师也很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.02,0:24:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观音像挂轴 被诅咒的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有性命交关的时候 才会说出真心话吧
